 href="/encyclopedia/narmer-palette"><img class="enc-thumb" src="/images/encyclopedia/narmer-palette.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="56" height="56"><span class="enc-name">Narmer Palette</span><span class="enc-type">Work / monument</span><span class="enc-snip">The Narmer Palette is a carved siltstone palette of about 3100 BCE found in the temple of Hierakonpolis (Nekhen) in 1897–1898.</span></a></li></ul>
